==Battleground==
*8 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

